{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54539","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军善，识得气妖祥。\n风角鸟占能总解，心无机巧计从长，报国效忠良。\n（既有其象，当随其景，就谋术，以破其军。\n）（按：以上二首据京本补，首本等入《占气第四》，稍异。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}